{"ref":"BDB, רָגַם","hw":"רָגַם","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">רָגַם</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. stone, kill by stoning (</strong>denom.? cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, סָקַל\" href=\"/BDB,_סָקַל\", dir=\"rtl\">סקל</a>; or orig. = <em>throw, hurl</em>? NH <span dir=\"rtl\">רָגַם</span> <em>throw at</em> (rare); Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">رَجَمَ</span> <em>throw stones at, stone</em>, also (from accompaniment of stone-throwing) <em>revile, curse</em>, cf. Ethiopic ረገመ <em>curse</em>, We<sup>Heid. 2. 111, 250</sup>; Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">רְגַם</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܪܓܰܡ</span> <em>stone</em><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. 3 pl. consec. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְרָֽגְמוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 24:14\" href=\"/Leviticus.24.14\">Lv 24:14</a> + 2 times, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וּרְגָמֻהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 21:21\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.21.21\">Dt 21:21</a>; Impf. 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִרְגְּמוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 20:16\" href=\"/Leviticus.20.16\">Lv 20:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 20:27\" href=\"/Leviticus.20.27\">27</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:25\" href=\"/Joshua.7.25\">Jos 7:25</a> + 4 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִרְגְּמֻהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 20:2\" href=\"/Leviticus.20.2\">Lv 20:2</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:21\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.21\">2 Ch 24:21</a>; Inf. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">רָגוֹם</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 24:16\" href=\"/Leviticus.24.16\">Lv 24:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:35\" href=\"/Numbers.15.35\">Nu 15:35</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">לִרְגּוֹם</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:10\" href=\"/Numbers.14.10\">14:10</a>;—<em>stone</em>, c. acc. pers. + <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּאֲבָנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 21:21\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.21.21\">Dt 21:21</a> (D), <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:10\" href=\"/Numbers.14.10\">Nu 14:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:35\" href=\"/Numbers.15.35\">15:35</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:36\" href=\"/Numbers.15.36\">36</a> (P), + <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּאֶבֶן</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:40\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.40\">Ez 16:40</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 20:2\" href=\"/Leviticus.20.2\">Lv 20:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 20:27\" href=\"/Leviticus.20.27\">27</a> (H); + acc. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶבֶן</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:25\" href=\"/Joshua.7.25\">Jos 7:25</a> (JE); <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 24:23\" href=\"/Leviticus.24.23\">Lv 24:23</a> (P); <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:21\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.21\">2 Ch 24:21</a>; c. ב pers. + acc. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶבֶן</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 12:18\" href=\"/I_Kings.12.18\">1 K 12:18</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 10:18\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.10.18\">2 Ch 10:18</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> pers. + acc. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶבֶן</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:47\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.47\">Ez 23:47</a>; c. acc. pers. alone <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 24:14\" href=\"/Leviticus.24.14\">Lv 24:14</a> (P); c. ב pers. alone, <span dir=\"rtl\">רָגוֹם יִרְגְּמוּ־בוֹ</span> v <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 24:16\" href=\"/Leviticus.24.16\">16</a> (P).—Syn. <span dir=\"rtl\">סקל</span> q.v.","next":"BDB, רִגְמָה","prev":"BDB, רֹגְלִים"}